'' WHICH 'operator let' -- by the value's type, a UDT through its own string cast included
'' ('let( byref as string )', 'byref as wstring', 'byval as string'). tiko crashed on the
'' UDT, handing the let its bytes as an FBSTRING. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/letpick-chain.bas -o tests/codegen/letpickchain.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/letpickchain.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [L] 5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [D] 2.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [SA] 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [L] 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [D] 1.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [L] 7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [L] 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [SA] 9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [SA] 8
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [cS][SA] 42
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [L]-1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [cN][W] 21
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [cW][W] 31
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [cN][B] 21
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [cW][B] 31
